cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Analysis code for: Carbon Emissions from Cell-Culture Plastics Across Europe (COST Action CA21108, NETSKINMODELS)"
abstract: "Python pipeline for literature-based polymer emission-factor retrieval, procurement-data processing and statistical analysis of the plastic consumption and carbon footprint of cell-culture consumables in 53 European dermatology research laboratories across 22 countries. The repository contains the analysis code together with the country-level results and the article figures; the laboratory-level survey records are not redistributed."
type: software
license: BSD-3-Clause
